HERO_STR_STATIC(hero_str_4030d312, "\302\2474.19: an `extern` is checked against the real header. Declare exactly the parameters the header has, at its widths \342\200\224 or, for a function the header declares variadic (`...`), the fixed shape this program calls it with");
HERO_STR_STATIC(hero_str_3ee1fa47, "`'s format string is not a literal at this shape \342\200\224 `");
