HERO_STR_STATIC(hero_str_34312024, "a `record` over a union may name ONE member, and that binds it soundly: reading through it is correct and construction sets the member it names. Two or more is what has no answer \342\200\224 C keeps the last one written, so `==` and `hash` walk the same bytes twice");
